ALVA — New Stage: Asperitas + Complete Stage Roster Redesign

Objective

Implement a major stage-system expansion in the Alva game.

This update has two primary goals:

1. Completely redesign the Stage Selection interface to accommodate 24 stage slots instead of the current two-stage layout, including a Random Stage button.
2. Create a fully playable third stage named Asperitas, a beautiful sky-themed arena made entirely of clouds, featuring a large central cloud platform and two smaller, independently animated cloud platforms with randomized movement and disappearance states.

This must be a complete, polished implementation integrated into the existing game—not a mockup or an isolated visual demonstration.

The existing Desert and City stages must remain fully functional, and the new functionality must work across Quick Battle, Watch Mode, and the existing stage-selection flow.

